WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.200 --> 00:00:02.484
Are you a marketing expert?

2
00:00:02.484 --> 00:00:04.120
Probably not.

3
00:00:04.120 --> 00:00:06.420
But you still want to gain clients.

4
00:00:06.420 --> 00:00:08.520
And that's why I built ViaCara.

5
00:00:08.520 --> 00:00:12.020
Hi, I'm Kyle, founder of ViaCara.

6
00:00:12.020 --> 00:00:16.620
My partner, she's a therapist, and she started about a year ago.

7
00:00:16.620 --> 00:00:18.120
And...

8
00:00:18.120 --> 00:00:23.320
I saw as she was building her practice, the certain things which she had

9
00:00:23.320 --> 00:00:26.520
to overcome in order to gain clients.

10
00:00:26.520 --> 00:00:30.920
And as a software engineer of over two decades,

11
00:00:30.920 --> 00:00:35.520
I saw that I had the skills to solve this problem.

12
00:00:35.520 --> 00:00:39.620
I want you to do the best work you can.

13
00:00:39.620 --> 00:00:42.420
And you don't have to become an expert in marketing.

14
00:00:42.420 --> 00:00:47.520
ViaCara is a platform which allows clients to express what their needs are,

15
00:00:47.520 --> 00:00:52.420
their goals and the logistics on how they want to be met.

16
00:00:52.420 --> 00:00:56.420
Practitioners come on and share their personality,

17
00:00:56.420 --> 00:01:00.620
their lived experiences and all their credentials.

18
00:01:00.620 --> 00:01:04.984
So the plan, we will be focusing our marketing efforts

19
00:01:04.984 --> 00:01:10.480
in Manchester initially and expanding out to the rest of the nation.

20
00:01:10.480 --> 00:01:13.080
We don't have a subscription model.

21
00:01:13.080 --> 00:01:18.780
It is free to set up an account and we give you two free introductions to

22
00:01:18.780 --> 00:01:20.080
trial us out.

23
00:01:20.080 --> 00:01:25.080
If you have any questions, please send me an email or send me a message

24
00:01:25.080 --> 00:01:27.680
and I'd be more than happy to answer those.

25
00:01:27.680 --> 00:01:29.680
I want to make this work for you.

26
00:01:29.680 --> 00:01:34.280
So join on to ViaCara and I look forward to seeing you there.
